<title>USA: Sun City Industries President Minkin dies.</title>
<headline>Sun City Industries President Minkin dies.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sun City Industries Inc said Thursday that President Gustave Minkin died on Sunday.</p>
<p>The company said Minkin had been a member of its management team for 27 years.</p>
<p>It made no mention of a successor.</p>
</text>
